                      ;  + GRPH_OUT (Schreibebenen, GRAPH O).
                      GRPH_PORT:
5923  00                      DEFB    00h                     ; ?? |.|
                      GRPH_IN:
5924  00                      DEFB    00h                     ; ?? |.|
                      GRPH_OUT:
5925  00                      DEFB    00h                     ; ?? |.|
